Subject: [PATCH v3 26/30] docs: kdoc_parser: use the new CFunction class
Date: Thu, 29 Jan 2026 09:08:17 +0100
Message-ID: <4ca4e256922bc42ce1c86e70c20e6a35a599fcfd.1769673038.git.mchehab+huawei@kernel.org>
